sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    actor Vendor
    actor Device
    participant UIA as Admin_UI
    participant UIV as Vendor_UI
    participant UIM as MAUI_UI
    participant AuthC as AuthController
    participant AuthS as AuthService
    participant UM as UserManager
    participant JWT as JwtToken
    participant PoiC as PoiController
    participant PoiS as PoiService
    participant AudioC as AudioController
    participant Store as AudioStorageService
    participant TTS as TtsGenerationService
    participant SyncC as SyncController
    participant SyncApiS as SyncService_Api
    participant SyncM as SyncService_Maui
    participant Narr as NarrationEngine
    participant AnaC as AnalyticsController
    participant AnaS as AnalyticsService
    participant TourC as TourController
    participant TourS as TourService
    participant VC as VendorController
    participant AC as AdminVendorController
    participant DB as AppDbContext_SQL

    Note over Admin,DB: UC01 Admin login
    Admin->>UIA: login
    UIA->>AuthC: Login
    AuthC->>AuthS: LoginAsync
    AuthS->>UM: FindByEmail_CheckPassword
    AuthS->>JWT: GenerateToken
    AuthS-->>AuthC: LoginResponse
    AuthC-->>UIA: token

    Note over Vendor,DB: UC02 Vendor register
    Vendor->>UIV: register
    UIV->>AuthC: VendorRegister
    AuthC->>AuthS: VendorRegisterAsync
    AuthS->>UM: CreateUser_AddVendorRole
    AuthS->>DB: InsertVendorPending
    AuthC-->>UIV: register_ok

    Note over Vendor,DB: UC03 Vendor login
    UIV->>AuthC: VendorLogin
    AuthC->>AuthS: LoginAsync
    AuthC->>AuthS: GetVendorStatusByEmailAsync
    AuthC->>AuthS: IsVendorApprovedAsync
    alt approved
        AuthC-->>UIV: token
    else blocked
        AuthC-->>UIV: forbidden
    end

    Note over Device,DB: UC04 Device register
    UIM->>AuthC: DeviceRegister
    AuthC->>AuthS: GetOrCreateDeviceTokenAsync
    AuthC-->>UIM: device_token

    Note over Admin,DB: UC05 Admin CRUD POI
    UIA->>PoiC: Create_Update_Delete_POI
    PoiC->>PoiS: CreateAsync_UpdateAsync_DeleteAsync
    PoiS->>DB: SavePoiChanges
    PoiC-->>UIA: poi_ok

    Note over Admin,DB: UC06 Upsert POI script
    UIA->>PoiC: UpsertScript
    PoiC->>PoiS: UpsertScriptAsync
    PoiS->>DB: SaveAudioScript
    PoiC-->>UIA: script_ok

    Note over Admin,DB: UC07 Upload generate audio
    alt upload_audio
        UIA->>AudioC: AdminUploadAudio
        AudioC->>Store: SaveAudioFileAsync
    else generate_tts
        UIA->>AudioC: AdminGenerateAudio
        AudioC->>TTS: GenerateFromTextAsync
    end
    AudioC->>DB: UpdateAudioPath
    AudioC-->>UIA: audio_ok

    Note over Device,DB: UC08 MAUI sync POIs
    UIM->>SyncM: SyncPoisAsync
    SyncM->>SyncC: Sync
    SyncC->>SyncApiS: GetChangesAsync
    SyncApiS->>DB: QueryChangedPois
    SyncC-->>SyncM: SyncResponse
    SyncM-->>UIM: UpsertLocalSQLite

    Note over Device,DB: UC09 Upload playback logs
    UIM->>Narr: TriggerPlayback
    Narr->>Narr: InsertLocalLog
    SyncM->>AnaC: BatchLog
    AnaC->>AnaS: SaveLogsAsync
    AnaS->>DB: InsertPlaybackLogs
    AnaC-->>SyncM: logs_saved

    Note over Admin,DB: UC10 Analytics
    UIA->>AnaC: Summary_TopPois_TopDevices_History_ActiveUsers
    AnaC->>AnaS: GetSummaryAsync_GetTopPoisAsync_GetTopDevicesAsync_GetUsageHistoryAsync_GetActiveUsersAsync
    AnaS->>DB: QueryAnalytics
    AnaC-->>UIA: analytics_data

    Note over Admin,DB: UC11 UC12 Tours
    UIA->>TourC: Create_Reorder_Tour
    TourC->>TourS: CreateAsync_ReorderAsync
    TourS->>DB: SaveTourStops
    TourC-->>UIA: tour_detail

    Note over Vendor,DB: UC13 UC14 Vendor profile
    UIV->>VC: UpdateProfile_ChangePassword
    VC->>DB: SaveVendorProfileIdentity
    VC-->>UIV: profile_ok

    Note over Vendor,DB: UC15 UC16 Vendor submit update media
    UIV->>VC: SubmitPOIUpdate_UploadStaging_UploadLogo
    VC->>Store: SaveTempMedia
    VC->>DB: InsertPendingRecords
    VC-->>UIV: pending_ok

    Note over Admin,DB: UC17 Admin review pending
    UIA->>AC: ApproveRejectPending
    AC->>DB: ApplyOrRejectPending
    AC-->>UIA: review_ok

    Note over Admin,Vendor: UC18 UC19 Payment flow
    UIA->>AC: CreateVendorPayment_UpdateVendorPaymentStatus
    AC->>DB: SavePaymentStatus
    UIV->>VC: SubmitPayment
    VC->>Store: SaveReceipt
    VC->>DB: UpdatePaymentPendingVerification
    VC-->>UIV: payment_ok
